# Opt-in filesystem polling for Vite's watcher.
#
# Leave empty (the default) on Linux-native Docker: inotify events propagate
# across the bind mount and HMR works without polling.
#
# Set VITE_USE_POLLING=1 only if HMR silently stops firing — the known cases are
# the WSL2 Docker backend and some macOS Docker Desktop setups where host edits
# do not produce inotify events inside the container. Polling costs CPU
# continuously, so it is never the default.
VITE_USE_POLLING=
